				App.
				<u>Praef.</u>
				10
			</span></i> (s. v. l.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			of women, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χέρσους φθαρῆναι</span>
			<i>pine away in</i> barrenness, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				1502
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>El.</u>
